OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother chilly and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith only a few breaks to blue skies.
OL,7,FExpecting to remain dry during the
OL,8,Fday. A light, cool breeze.
OL,9,FTemperatures close to the seasonal
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLight spells of rain will
OL,13,Farrive during the late evening. This
OL,14,Fmay be persistent for some during the
OL,15,Fnight. Calm winds but feeling damp and
OL,16,Fchilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
