OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAlthough it will be cloudy
OL,6,Fwith spells of light rain during the
OL,7,Fmorning, a drier afternoon is expected
OL,8,Fwith the odd bright or sunny spell
OL,9,Fparticularly in the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny
OL,12,Fspells throughout Sunday but still
OL,13,Frather chilly. Frost and fog for some
OL,14,Fon Monday morning, then a sunny autumn
OL,15,Fday. Sunny to start on Tuesday, with
OL,16,Frain arriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
